    "norm": "Verifies that {@link RandomStringGenerator.Builder#withinRange(char[][])} rejects a range pair whose minimum code point is greater than its maximum. <p>The pair {@code {'L', '\u0000'}} maps to minimum code point 76 (the letter 'L') and maximum code point 0 (the NUL character, the default value of an uninitialized char). Since 76 &gt; 0, the builder must throw an {@link IllegalArgumentException} reported by Apache Commons Lang's {@code Validate}.</p>"
